        "1": {
            "ID": "703404",
            "URL": "https://thetvdb.com/series/akashic-records-of-bastard-magic-instructor/seasons/official/1",
            "Titles": {
                "eng": "Akashic Records of Bastard Magic Instructor",
                "jpn": null
            },
            "Summaries": {
                "eng": "The story takes place in the prestigious Alzano Imperial Magic Academy, located in the southern part of the Alzano Empire, where students train in the highest forms of magic. Two of the students, Sistine Fibel and Rumia Tingel, are determined to become great magicians: Sistine is motivated by her grandfather’s last wish, while Rumia hides a deeper secret tied to her past. Their new instructor is Glenn Radars, a substitute teacher who appears totally unmotivated, lazy, and seemingly incompetent. On the surface he’s a “bastard” magic instructor.",
                "jpn": null
            },
            "# Episodes": 12,
            "Episodes": {
                "1": {
                    "ID": "6001116",
                    "TYPE": null,
                    "URL": "https://www.thetvdb.com/series/akashic-records-of-bastard-magic-instructor/episodes/6001116",
                    "Titles": {
                        "eng": "The Unmotivated Bastard",
                        "jpn": "やる気のないロクでなし"
                    },
                    "Summaries": {
                        "eng": "Glenn is a bastard who only sleeps instead of teaching class at the Alzano Imperial Magic Academy. When one of his excellent students, Sistine, finally gets fed up, she challenges him to a duel to make him teach properly.",
                        "jpn": "グレンは、アルザノインペリアルマジックアカデミーでクラスを教える代わりに眠るだけのろくでなしです。 彼の優秀な生徒の一人であるシスティンがついにうんざりしたとき、彼女は彼に決闘を挑み、彼に適切に教えさせます。"
                    },
                    "Aliases": []
                },
                "2": {
                    "ID": "6030443",
                    "TYPE": null,
                    "URL": "https://www.thetvdb.com/series/akashic-records-of-bastard-magic-instructor/episodes/6030443",
                    "Titles": {
                        "eng": "Just the Slightest Bit of Motivation",
                        "jpn": "ほんのわずかなやる気"
                    },
                    "Summaries": {
                        "eng": "Even after losing the duel, Glenn lacks all motivation. Yet through his interactions with Sistine and Rumia, he eventually starts genuinely teaching classes that will help them. Meanwhile, suspicious men show up at the academy…",
                        "jpn": "決闘に敗れてもやる気ゼロのグレン。しかしシスティーナとルミアとの交流をきっかけに、真面目でためになる授業を講じるようになる。そんな折、学院に怪しい男たちが…。"
                    },
                    "Aliases": []
                },
                "3": {
                    "ID": "6030497",
                    "TYPE": null,
                    "URL": "https://www.thetvdb.com/series/akashic-records-of-bastard-magic-instructor/episodes/6030497",
                    "Titles": {
                        "eng": "The Fool and Death",
                        "jpn": "愚者と死神"
                    },
                    "Summaries": {
                        "eng": "The evil mages infiltrating the academy are terrorists belonging to the magic society, Researchers of Divine Wisdom. In order to rescue his students taken captive, Glenn finally exercises his real power.",
                        "jpn": "学院に侵入してきたのは外道魔術師達の魔術結社「天の智慧研究会」のテロリストだった。人質に取られた生徒達を救出するため、グレンは遂にその本領を発揮する。"
                    },
                    "Aliases": []
                },
                "4": {
                    "ID": "6030498",
                    "TYPE": null,
                    "URL": "https://www.thetvdb.com/series/akashic-records-of-bastard-magic-instructor/episodes/6030498",
                    "Titles": {
                        "eng": "The Magic Competition",
                        "jpn": "魔術競技祭"
                    },
                    "Summaries": {
                        "eng": "Hoping to earn the special reward, Glenn aims to win the magic competition. While Sistine and the others don't know his reason, they all work hard to meet his expectations and start showing unexpected results.",
                        "jpn": "特別賞与を目当てに魔術競技祭での優勝を目指すグレン。システィーナ達はそうとは知らずに彼の期待に応えるべく奮闘し、予想外の活躍を見せ始める。"
                    },
                    "Aliases": []
                },
                "5": {
                    "ID": "6030499",
                    "TYPE": null,
                    "URL": "https://www.thetvdb.com/series/akashic-records-of-bastard-magic-instructor/episodes/6030499",
                    "Titles": {
                        "eng": "The Queen and the Princess",
                        "jpn": "女王と王女"
                    },
                    "Summaries": {
                        "eng": "Rumia comes becomes a suspect during the magic competition and the imperial guard targets her life. Glenn manages to save her in the nick of time, but an unexpected individual stands in his way.",
                        "jpn": "魔術競技祭の最中、ルミアがとある容疑をかけられて王室親衛隊から命を狙われることに。間一髪のところでルミアを助け出したグレンだったが、思わぬ人物に行く手を阻まれる。"
                    },
                    "Aliases": []
                },
                "6": {
                    "ID": "6030500",
                    "TYPE": null,
                    "URL": "https://www.thetvdb.com/series/akashic-records-of-bastard-magic-instructor/episodes/6030500",
                    "Titles": {
                        "eng": "The Evil Being",
                        "jpn": "邪悪なる存在"
                    },
                    "Summaries": {
                        "eng": "The ones pulling the strings behind the imperial guard were the Researchers of Divine Wisdom. Glenn fights to clear Rumia of suspicion. Meanwhile, in the magic competition, the students of Class 2 face…",
                        "jpn": "王室親衛隊の裏で糸を引いているのは「天の智慧研究会」だった。グレンはルミアの容疑を晴らすべく立ち上がる。一方、魔術競技祭で二組の生徒たちの前に現れたのは…。"
                    },
                    "Aliases": []
                },
                "7": {
                    "ID": "6030501",
                    "TYPE": null,
                    "URL": "https://www.thetvdb.com/series/akashic-records-of-bastard-magic-instructor/episodes/6030501",
                    "Titles": {
                        "eng": "The Sea of Falling Stars",
                        "jpn": "星降る海"
                    },
                    "Summaries": {
                        "eng": "Re=L joins the academy to guard Rumia, and thanks to her interactions with Sistine and the others slowly integrates into class. She gets along well with her classmates at first during their field research, but…",
                        "jpn": "ルミアの警護のため学院に編入してきたリィエル。システィーナ達との交流で次第に溶け込んでいく彼女。遠征学修の先でも当初は学友たちと打ち解けていた彼女だったが…。"
                    },
                    "Aliases": []
                },
                "8": {
                    "ID": "6030502",
                    "TYPE": null,
                    "URL": "https://www.thetvdb.com/series/akashic-records-of-bastard-magic-instructor/episodes/6030502",
                    "Titles": {
                        "eng": "The Fool and the Star",
                        "jpn": "愚者と星"
                    },
                    "Summaries": {
                        "eng": "When they arrive at the location for their field research, Sistine and the others observe the white alchemy lab. On the way back, Re=L acts on her own, meeting with her long separated brother, and they confront Glenn as he rushes to the scene.",
                        "jpn": "遠征学修の目的地である白金魔導研究所を見学するシスティーナ達。帰り際、別行動を取ったリィエルは生き別れた兄と出会い、その場に駆け付けたグレンと対峙する。"
                    },
                    "Aliases": []
                },
                "9": {
                    "ID": "6030503",
                    "TYPE": null,
                    "URL": "https://www.thetvdb.com/series/akashic-records-of-bastard-magic-instructor/episodes/6030503",
                    "Titles": {
                        "eng": "The Reason to Live",
                        "jpn": "生きる意味"
                    },
                    "Summaries": {
                        "eng": "Mortally wounded, Glenn manages to hang on by a thread thanks to Sistine's magic. They chase after Re=L who kidnapped Rumia, and Glen storms into the white alchemy lab alongside Albert.",
                        "jpn": "致命傷を負わされたグレンはシスティーナの魔術で一命を取り留める。ルミアを連れ去ったリィエルを追って、グレンはアルベルトと共に白金魔導研究所へと乗り込んでいく。"
                    },
                    "Aliases": []
                },
                "10": {
                    "ID": "6030504",
                    "TYPE": null,
                    "URL": "https://www.thetvdb.com/series/akashic-records-of-bastard-magic-instructor/episodes/6030504",
                    "Titles": {
                        "eng": "Gold Digger!?",
                        "jpn": "逆玉！？"
                    },
                    "Summaries": {
                        "eng": "After returning from their field research, Glenn and the others spend their days in different ways. On one such day, Leos visits the academy as a guest instructor, and causes a stir by proclaiming himself Sistine's fiance.",
                        "jpn": "遠征学修から戻り、思い思いの日々を送るグレン達。そんなある日、学院に特別講師としてやってきたレオスがシスティーナの婚約者だと名乗り出て波乱が起きる。"
                    },
                    "Aliases": []
                },
                "11": {
                    "ID": "6030505",
                    "TYPE": null,
                    "URL": "https://www.thetvdb.com/series/akashic-records-of-bastard-magic-instructor/episodes/6030505",
                    "Titles": {
                        "eng": "Face Off! The Magic Corps Battle",
                        "jpn": "決戦！　魔導兵団戦"
                    },
                    "Summaries": {
                        "eng": "Glenn and Leos enter a duel involving the other students in a magic corps battle. Leos's camp is well organized, but Glenn fights back with clever tactics.",
                        "jpn": "グレンとレオスは生徒達を巻き込んだ魔導兵団戦演習によって決闘をすることに。統率の取れたレオスの陣営にグレンは奇策を弄して立ち向かっていく。"
                    },
                    "Aliases": []
                },
                "12": {
                    "ID": "6030506",
                    "TYPE": null,
                    "URL": "https://www.thetvdb.com/series/akashic-records-of-bastard-magic-instructor/episodes/6030506",
                    "Titles": {
                        "eng": "Finding One's Own Place",
                        "jpn": "見つけた居場所"
                    },
                    "Summaries": {
                        "eng": "Preparations begin for Sistine and Leos' wedding ceremony. Rumia holds out faith that the vanished Glenn will return, but they still have no word from him by the day of the wedding.",
                        "jpn": "システィーナとレオスの結婚式の準備が始まった。ルミアは姿を消したグレンが戻って来ることを信じていたが、音沙汰もないまま結婚式当日を迎えてしまう。"
                    },
                    "Aliases": []
                }
            }
        }
    }
}